'''Reaper''' is a [[Sub-Roles#Flanker|Flanker]] [[Roles#Damage|Damage]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. He is one of the 21 heroes included in the game's release on 24 May 2016.

==Overview==
[[File:Reaper HS.mp4|left|thumb]] Hellfire Shotguns, the ghostly ability to become immune to damage, and the power to step between shadows make Reaper one of the deadliest beings on Earth.

